    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Crea (Crea Studio) is a small multidisciplinary design lab, Austin, Texas, founded 2018 by artist/designer Bruno Canales. Specialises in 3D animation and motion design: kinetic identity, abstract CGI, branded motion. Notable projects: The Tide (London park kinetic brand with Droga5, 2019, Best of Behance), Fuego (abstract 3D motion branding, 2019), Tarraco (SEAT car brand CGI, 2020), Nobl Organizations (abstract org motion, 2019), Balloon (3D simulation experiment, 2019). Founder Bruno Canales has since moved to Apple (per LinkedIn, 2026). Work Status Studio is current for the entity. crea.st website is DNS-unresolvable at capture time; Behance (behance.net/crea_st) is the active portfolio. Instagram (crea.st) returned error page logged-out; queued to state/ig-queue.json for ig.py grab. LinkedIn set: linkedin.com/company/crea-st. Work captured from Behance CDN across 5 distinct projects (12 images). Autonomy not set (studio-level org entry, not a solo person).",
